      "Muscle MRI may show selective muscle atrophy",
      "Nerve ultrasound may show nerve enlargement in some cases"
    ],
    "genetic": [
      "Pathogenic mutations in GJB1 gene (connexin 32) on X chromosome",
      "Other rare X-linked gene mutations associated with axonal neuropathy",
      "X-linked recessive inheritance"
    ],
